OL,3,GNEWSAEscaped monkey returns to Highland
OL,4,AWildlife Park enclosure
OL,5,
OL,6,FA young monkey that managed to get out
OL,7,Fof a wildlife park at the centre of a
OL,8,Fsimilar monkey escape two years ago has
OL,9,Freturned to his enclosure.
OL,11,FThe Royal Zoological Society of
OL,12,FScotland (RZSS) launched a search for
OL,13,FLuka after he disappeared overnight
OL,14,Ffrom the Highland Wildlife Park, near
OL,15,FAviemore, in the Cairngorms National
OL,16,FPark.
OL,18,FIt is understood Luka, a five-year-old
OL,19,FJapanese macaque, managed to get back
OL,20,Finto his enclosure by himself.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,424,420,260,160,0,100
