OL,3,GNEWSAEscaped monkey returns to Highland
OL,4,AWildlife Park enclosure
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn January 2024, another monkey from
OL,7,Fthe same species went on the run for
OL,8,Fmore than five days after it fled the
OL,9,Fpark, apparently after a fight with
OL,10,Fother male monkeys.
